+/*
+ * A sync file of a syncobj, as Panfrost makes one for every pipe fence (pan_fence.c panfrost_fence_create: export the
+ * context's syncobj, import it into the fence's own): here a copy of what the syncobj is waiting for at that moment,
+ * kept in this process under a real file descriptor (of /dev/null, so that the close() Panfrost does is an ordinary
